      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate reported a gross prior year reserve release of GBP 1.2 million in 2019, representing a 2.2% reduction of its opening gross claims outstanding. This release was observed despite the 2017 year of account closing with a net loss of GBP 5.3m, impacted by natural catastrophe events such as Hurricanes Harvey, Irma and Maria, earthquakes in Mexico, and Californian wildfires. Conversely, the 2018 year of account was forecast to generate a profit, with a specific net profit release of GBP 7.9 million approved, indicating favorable development for that year, despite being impacted by events like Hawaii lava flow, Typhoon Jebi, Hurricanes Florence and Michael, and Californian wildfires Camp and Woolsey.",
